- Field_11 has a high threat level of 0.13 and currently has 6 drones protecting it; it requires 9 drones for full protection.
- Field_123 has a threat level of 0.10 and currently has 7 drones protecting it but requires 9 drones for full protection.

Both of these fields are in need of more drones to reach full protection. 

